  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あれ？　まだいたのか、真乃\r\nもう遅いぞ？",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004030010,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "あ、プロデューサーさん……\r\nほわっ、もうこんな時間だったんですね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100403/2001004030010"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "写真を見てたんだ？\r\nそれは……この間撮った、宣材写真か",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004030020,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はい。撮った後にも見せてもらいましたが\r\nもう一度、見てみたくなったんです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100403/2001004030020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004030030,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ずっと前に撮った写真よりも、\r\n自然な笑顔になってる気がします",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100403/2001004030030"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、\r\nかわいく撮れてる",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004030040,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわっ！\r\nか、かわいい……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100403/2001004030040"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？\r\nそんなに驚くのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いつもカメラマンさんやファンに、\r\nかわいいって言ってもらってるだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004030050,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "そ、それは……そうですけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100403/2001004030050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004030060,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "他の方からかわいいって言われるのと、\r\nプロデューサーさんが言ってくれるのじゃ、違います……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100403/2001004030060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004030070,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんはいつも、\r\nいい感じに撮れてるな、みたいな言い方ですから……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100403/2001004030070"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうなのか\r\nじゃあ、これからはもっとかわいいって言っていこうか",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004030080,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわわっ\r\nいえ、そんなにいつも言ってもらわなくても！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100403/2001004030080"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうなんだ？\r\nまぁでも、かわいいのはかわいいからなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004030090,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわわ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100403/2001004030090"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "あの……\r\nじゃあ、どの写真がよく撮れてると思いますか？",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100403/2001004030100"
  },
  {
    "select": "優しく微笑んでいる写真",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "ウインクしている写真",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "ほわっとした顔の写真",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "優しく微笑んでいる写真",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004030110,
    "label": "1",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "これ……あまりアイドルらしくない笑い方のような……？\r\n他のアイドルの方はもっと、笑顔がまぶしい感じです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100403/2001004030110"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうかな？\r\nこれが一番真乃らしく撮れてると思うよ",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "写真を見た人が、つられて優しい気持ちになって\r\n穏やかな笑顔になれるような力がある",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004030120,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわ……もしそうなってくれるならすごくうれしいですっ\r\nありがとうございます、プロデューサーさん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100403/2001004030120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004030130,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……あの、\r\nこの写真、私がもらっても良いですか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100403/2001004030130"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いいよ。写真のデータは残ってるしね",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004030140,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "わあ、ありがとうございます",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100403/2001004030140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004030150,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "それじゃあ……あの……\r\nもしこれ、よかったら……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100403/2001004030150"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え……俺にくれるのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004030160,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はい、いつも頑張ってくれて、\r\n大変そうなプロデューサーさんが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100403/2001004030160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004030170,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "少しでも笑顔になってくれたらって思って……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100403/2001004030170"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか\r\n俺は、真乃からいつも元気をもらってるんだけどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも……うん、もらっておくよ\r\nありがとう",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004030180,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はい。これからもいい笑顔を撮ってもらえるように、\r\n私、頑張りますね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100403/2001004030180"
  },
  {
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ウインクしている写真"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004030190,
    "label": "2",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "こ、これですか！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100403/2001004030190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004030200,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "この写真は、その……\r\nカメラマンさんに思い切ってみてって言われて……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100403/2001004030200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004030210,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "わ、私じゃないみたいで……\r\n恥ずかしいです……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100403/2001004030210"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなことないよ、\r\nこれも真乃で間違いない",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "新しい真乃の魅力が、よく出ているよ",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004030220,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "本当……ですか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100403/2001004030220"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "改めてこの写真を見て、どう思う？",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004030230,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "最初は、私らしくないんじゃないかなって\r\n感じてました",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100403/2001004030230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004030240,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "でも、プロデューサーさんに言われてみると、\r\n私もこんな表情ができるようになったんだなって……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100403/2001004030240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004030250,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "そんなふうに思えてきました",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100403/2001004030250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004030260,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "この写真、いただいてもいいですか？\r\n今のプロデューサーさんの言葉、忘れずにいたいんです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100403/2001004030260"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん。データはあるし、持っていくといいよ"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004030270,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ありがとうございます\r\n新しい私、これからもっと出せるように頑張りますねっ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100403/2001004030270"
  },
  {
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ほわっとした顔の写真",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004030280,
    "label": "3",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "これは……自分では、あまり良いとは思ってませんでした\r\nなんだか力が抜けすぎてる気がして……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100403/2001004030280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004030290,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "最初の頃から\r\n成長してないように思えてしまいます",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100403/2001004030290"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうかな？\r\nよし、少し待ってて",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "blank"
  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "black",
    "effectTarget": {
      "type": "rect",
      "width": 1136,
      "height": 640,
      "color": "000000"
    },
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "from",
      "x": 1000,
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000
    }
  },
  {
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "black",
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000,
      "easing": "easeInQuart"
    }
  },
  {
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "最初の頃に撮った写真を持ってきたよ\r\nさっきの写真と並べてみよう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004030300,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "やっぱり前とは変わってないような……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100403/2001004030300"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もっとよく見て？\r\n同じような表情でも、今の写真の方が輝けてるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004030310,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "そう言われてみればそんなふうにも……？\r\n私、成長できてるんでしょうか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100403/2001004030310"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今の写真も前の写真も、真乃らしい１枚だね\r\nだけど、今の真乃の方が――",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "アイドルとして、魅力的だと思うよ"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004030320,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわ……プロデューサーさんに、そう言ってもらえると\r\n……とてもうれしいですっ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100403/2001004030320"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004030330,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "私、アイドルになって……\r\nもっと、もっと自分を変えたいって思っていて……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100403/2001004030330"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004030340,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "あの、この写真、２枚ともいただいていいですか？\r\n変われてるっていつでも確かめられるようにしたいんです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100403/2001004030340"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、いいよ\r\nこれからも、真乃はどんどん成長していくからな",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004030350,
